 ['the JSON of the chapter: loads gives the dictionary, dumps gives the same text back', 'import json\njs = \'{"name": "Alice Doe", "age": 30, "car": null, "programmer": true, "address": {"street": "100 Larkin St.", "city": "San Francisco", "zip": "94102"}, "phone": [{"type": "mobile", "number": "415-555-7890"}, {"type": "work", "number": "415-555-1234"}]}\'\npd = json.loads(js)\nprint(pd)\nprint(json.dumps(pd) == js)\nprint(json.dumps(pd, indent=2))', '{\'name\': \'Alice Doe\', \'age\': 30, \'car\': None, \'programmer\': True, \'address\': {\'street\': \'100 Larkin St.\', \'city\': \'San Francisco\', \'zip\': \'94102\'}, \'phone\': [{\'type\': \'mobile\', \'number\': \'415-555-7890\'}, {\'type\': \'work\', \'number\': \'415-555-1234\'}]}\nTrue\n{\n  "name": "Alice Doe",\n  "age": 30,\n  "car": null,\n  "programmer": true,\n  "address": {\n    "street": "100 Larkin St.",\n    "city": "San Francisco",\n    "zip": "94102"\n  },\n  "phone": [\n    {\n      "type": "mobile",\n      "number": "415-555-7890"\n    },\n    {\n      "type": "work",\n      "number": "415-555-1234"\n    }\n  ]\n}'],
